# Package catalog: selectors provider package [option]
# Selectors: platform or package manager from install-platforms.list.
# apt shares packages between Debian and Ubuntu.
# Providers: native (apt/dnf/pacman/apk), brew, cask, tap, uv.
# Options: unlinked for macOS brew; trusted for tap; command for LFS probes.
# No inline comments.
# Keep shared packages on one row; distro-specific names need separate rows.
# Consumed by install.sh and homebrew/Brewfile. See docs/installation.md.

# native
